            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text">
              <label>人體圖頭面左列</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">頷厭之分／和髎之分／地倉大迎之分</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text">
              <label>人體圖圖面左手</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">寸口／合谷之次／神門之次</seg>
            </ab>
