            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f05-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">醫事難問</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f05-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">問人迎氣口三部</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f05-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">九候問曰人迎氣口古今異其所三部九候亦</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f05-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">其所指不同請聞明解</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f05-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">對人迎氣口三部九候問</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f05-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">謹按所謂人迎足陽明胃經之動脉即在結喉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f05-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">兩旁各一寸半也動輸本輸經脉篇已有明證</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f05-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">所謂氣口手太陰肺經之動脉兩手所同稱也</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f05-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一名寸口一名脉口是名雖三而實則一耳內</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="10" xml:id="f05-l-c10">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">經難經亦有明證逮晉之王叔和左手為人迎</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f05-l-c10">
              <label>第1有字欄題名下小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">己未二月十七日</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：圖籤方向依影像位置，手圖手別依墨字。「頷／顑」「髎」「箕」「太／大」為需留意之字，足旁只見單字，不補。中部人標字落於大腿旁，連線來源需另作圖層。兩腕三格皆有「浮中沉」三小字。圖像與紅點座標未轉換。 左面：題名、日期及首問同欄分區。第6有字欄依底本讀「動輸本輸」，不以字書改俞。字形「脉」原形。無可確定返點。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="6" facs="#f06" />
        <div n="6" type="scan" subtype="clinical-questions-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">以候表右手為氣口以候裏而東垣李氏宗之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">自茲厥後歷代醫師無不尊信之至明之景岳</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">張氏極言其非曰如脉見緊數此寒邪外感也</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">然未有左數而右不數者又如所云左大者為</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">風邪右大者為飲食則尤其不然夫人生稟賦</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之常凡右脉大者十居八九左脉大者十居一</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">二若果陽邪在表則大者更大豈以右脉本大</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f06-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而可認為食乎若飲食在藏則強者愈強豈以</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f06-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">左脉本強而可認為寒乎可謂的確之論矣所</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f06-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">謂三部九候上古診法分人身上中下謂之三</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f06-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">部部有三候三而三之故為九候也三部九候</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f06-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">論可以見已仲景取寸口與趺陽亦此意也越</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f06-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">人之難經異乎此曰三部者寸關尺也九候者</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f06-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">浮中沈也是分三部九候於寸口也後世診家</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f06-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">皆宗之是雖其所指不同而素難之所說及仲</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f06-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">景之所論三法鼎立所宜取法也</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：右第2欄「自茲厥後」首三字待校。原作脉。 左面：左第3欄「已」近「己」，「越」依本圖；第5欄作「沈」，對照圖內小字之候選「沉」可再核。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:3">
              <quote>已</quote>
              <note type="editorial">左第3欄「已」近「己」，「越」依本圖；第5欄作「沈」，對照圖內小字之候選「沉」可再核。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:3">
              <quote>越</quote>
              <note type="editorial">左第3欄「已」近「己」，「越」依本圖；第5欄作「沈」，對照圖內小字之候選「沉」可再核。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:5">
              <quote>沈</quote>
              <note type="editorial">左第3欄「已」近「己」，「越」依本圖；第5欄作「沈」，對照圖內小字之候選「沉」可再核。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="7" facs="#f07" />
        <div n="7" type="scan" subtype="clinical-questions-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f07-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">問久病治法</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f07-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">問曰一男年雖四九形體瘦弱脉細無力四肢</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f07-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">怠倦左腹有塊如拳按之甚堅動則築然而痛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f07-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">兩目時昏時明兩耳時聰時聾詢其致病之由</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f07-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">少年緣樹墜下觸傷陰囊去血甚多以成斯</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f07-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">症是傷在何經治用何藥幸顯示至理</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f07-r-c06">
              <label>第1欄題名下小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">三月十七日</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f07-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">附錄治驗一條</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f07-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">伊勢屋源助妻二十餘歲稟賦怯弱去三載前</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f07-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">產一女子胎前日吐血少則半合多則一合或</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f07-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">至七八合及期不已產後又一日吐血七八合</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f07-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">後不復吐血唯是胎前娩後將養失所以故虛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f07-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">羸勞倦往來寒熱咳嗽口乾五心煩熱時有盜</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f07-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">汗氣息喘之顏色憔悴今茲己未之春患苦益</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f07-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">甚延余請治診之六脉無力浮大而數重按之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f07-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">則欲絕是由氣血兩虛而致也治宜補血益氣</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f07-l-c09">
              <label>第1欄題名下小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">己未三月</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：右第3欄「怠／急」「築」待校。第4欄前「兩」為異體手寫，形與第二個「兩」有別。 左面：左第5欄「娩」候選，草筆足旁近兔。左第7欄「之」候選「乏」。第8欄末「重按」墨較深。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:5">
              <quote>娩</quote>
              <note type="editorial">左第5欄「娩」候選，草筆足旁近兔。左第7欄「之」候選「乏」。第8欄末「重按」墨較深。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:None">
              <quote>之</quote>
              <note type="editorial">左第5欄「娩」候選，草筆足旁近兔。左第7欄「之」候選「乏」。第8欄末「重按」墨較深。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:8">
              <quote>重按</quote>
              <note type="editorial">左第5欄「娩」候選，草筆足旁近兔。左第7欄「之」候選「乏」。第8欄末「重按」墨較深。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="8" facs="#f08" />
        <div n="8" type="scan" subtype="clinical-questions-text">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f08-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">扶脾清肺之劑方用六君子湯合生脉散加當</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f08-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">歸芍藥柴胡連進十餘日前證減半但咳嗽喘</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f08-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之有時腹痛仍於前方中出入加減隨時變易</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f08-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">三旬之後愈十之七八兩月乃復故</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f08-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">問麻疹</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f08-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">問曰麻疹一證其流行也隔二三十年輒又罕</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f08-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">見其病自非成人不能悉其證以天正以來考</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f08-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之多在二十四五年之間予生十三年而遭此</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f08-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">病實安永丙申也迄今茲寬政己未相去凡二</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f08-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">十四年因思此病流行蓋在一二年之間吾</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f08-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">輩之所當講習也幸明示麻疹之原與證治之</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f08-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">大法以開茅塞</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f08-l-c08">
              <label>第1欄題名下小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">四月十七日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f08-l-c08">
              <label>第3欄「非」旁夾小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">弱</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：續第07幅左頁附錄。 左面：左第2欄末「輒」形繁，近「輙」；第3欄「弱」旁註與正文的插入關係待校。「安永丙申」「寬政己未」兩紀年可辨。此幅左面書寫為流行時距及作者自述。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="9" facs="#f09" />
        <div n="9" type="scan" subtype="appendix-case-report">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f09-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一男子年五十餘患脫肛調治百日而愈尒後</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f09-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">腰腹之間攣引絞痛數十日覺於腰腹間如百</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f09-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">條麻線觧散下于兩足直到脚底乃後却囘上</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f09-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">行兩股入腰腹間少時而又發如初君此者晝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f09-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">夜五六度殆四五十日衆醫爲疝爲蛇或氣或</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f09-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">梅雜治不驗於此召余診之顏色蒼黃肌肉</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f09-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">漸削氣力少衰飮食不進大便或祕或溏小水</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f09-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">如常夜不能安睡兩脈細微無力腹心之動彈</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f09-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">指</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
