          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="10" facs="#f10" />
        <div n="10" type="scan" subtype="appendix-case-report">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f10-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">右樋口先生所示病狀一篇命允成慮之治</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f10-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">允成性稟下愚何足塞命然辱備醫官之員</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f10-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">不敢顧淺陋陳愚意如左</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f10-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">謹按前証齡已過半百卽形神已衰也其患</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f10-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">脫肛者難徑曰病之虛實入者爲實出者爲</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f10-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">虛是脫肛爲屬虛也唯未審其人之稟賦能</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f10-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">弱與乎昔苦樂也以臆度之所謂虛者脾胃</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f10-r-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">虛也夫脾胃虛則肺气位虛所以胃之與肺</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f10-r-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">俱下陷於大腸而致脫肛也調治之者蓋用</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f10-r-c09">
              <label>右頁第一欄命下偏右正文</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">允成</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f10-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">補中益氣之輩以升提胃氣而清陽升濁陰</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f10-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">降而得愈也其腰腹致病而又從腰腹至脚</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f10-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">下麻痺者卽是氣疝也蓋疝之爲病屬足厥</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f10-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">陰而多生於溼熱肝屬下部其性慓悍從腰</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f10-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">腹至脚下溫熱動下也攣引致痛囘氣凝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f10-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">滯走注麻痺從氣之升降也李梃云疝痛走</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f10-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">注無形屬氣是也顏色蒼黃以下症者病</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="8" xml:id="f10-l-c08">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">苦日久而形神俱虛也如脈亦然不安睡者</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="9" xml:id="f10-l-c09">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">神魂不寧也所謂心腹之動者豈腎間之動</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：「負」左旁薄，候負／責。第4欄「証」從言正。第5欄「難徑」的徑形候經。第8欄肺後寫簡短气形。 左面：第4欄溼右下見小土形，「慓悍」的慓也候慓／剽。第5欄近頂的至筆較濃。第6欄「李梃」末字左木右廷。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="right:5">
              <quote>難徑</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">難徑</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">難經</seg>
              <note type="editorial">原圖留讀及異讀候選。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="11" facs="#f11" />
        <div n="11" type="scan" subtype="appendix-case-report">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f11-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">邪是虛極之甚不可不恐也法當先治其麻</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f11-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">痺此所謂急則治其標者也宜主用當</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f11-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">枯痛湯補氣升陽潤血滋陰驅逐風濕而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f11-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">後隨症調治則可奏全效也茲述管見</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f11-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">高明垂教</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f11-r-c05">
              <label>右頁分列日期</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">甲寅五月</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f11-r-c05">
              <label>右頁同行不同高度署款</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">澁江允成謹書</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f11-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">一婦年二十一始姙七月胸間煩熱心下痞滿口中</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f11-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">糜爛飮水日晝一斗手足無腫腹滿引兩脇小水晝</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f11-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">夜六七度量飮水之半胎下墜活動無力脈細數食</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f11-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無味強下二三椀如此者三四十月諸療無効</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f11-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">七日</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f11-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">右</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f11-l-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">謹按前症是上消也蓋消渴之爲病以陽盛陰衰</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f11-l-c07">
              <label>左頁第四欄末小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">五月</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f11-l-c07">
              <label>左頁「右」下端署款</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">樋口道仙</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第3欄起「枯」左木右古，與上一欄末「當」接續，照抄形保留。驅後「逐」筆形簡化，候逐／涿。末段日期在上，澁江位置居下，允成凸出右側，謹書在署名以下。 左面：第2欄兩個晝字皆有底橫。第4欄十後字手寫略似月，按封框和位置暫讀日。日期「五月」在第4欄下端，「七日」換一短欄，兩處在讀序相接。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:4">
              <quote>三四十月</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">三四十月</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">三四十日</seg>
              <note type="editorial">原圖留讀及異讀候選。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="12" facs="#f12" />
        <div n="12" type="scan" subtype="appendix-case-report">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f12-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">也所謂陽盛卽心火亢極也所謂陰衰卽腎水虛</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f12-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">渴則不能制肺也胎下墜活動無力者以心火熾</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f12-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">盛則肺氣虛之氣不能以保胎也脈細數者是陰</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f12-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">虛火盛也法當先用竹葉石膏湯瀉心火洩肺</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f12-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">燥也姜竹葉石膏之辛寒俱入心肺瀉上焦煩熱</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f12-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">麥冬之甘寒除熱止渴參艸粳米之甘平保胃生</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f12-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">津半夏之辛溫通氣化液也而心肺位近宜小其</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f12-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">制況石膏半夏爲姙家禁藥乎而有故無殞但當</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f12-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">斟酌爾若用前劑而諸症稍退則宜用安胎清補</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f12-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">之劑而後子母壯健乃其生如達可以報成績也</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f12-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">敢請正</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f12-l-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">右</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f12-l-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">治驗</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f12-l-c06">
              <label>左頁「右」下端署款</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">澁江道陸</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f12-l-c06">
              <label>左頁「治驗」下端另署</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">澁江道陸</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第4欄末「洩」左見水點，右有長直及斜末筆，候洩／泄；第6欄遒勁寫艸，米旁字形近粳。 左面：第1欄「殞」偏旁淡，「達」第3欄辶可辨。兩署對應上方分列，頁面左側另見若干短墨點。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="13" facs="#f13" />
        <div n="13" type="scan" subtype="appendix-case-report">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f13-r-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">商人儀兵衛年過不惑稟弱形瘦初夏病疫脈浮</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f13-r-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">而數憎寒壯熱身痛頭疼自汗不食與九味羌甜湯</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f13-r-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">四五日脈弦細頭痛發熱耳聾嘔噦舌胎白滑更</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f13-r-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">作小柴胡湯二三日忽發寒戰家人駭而告予予曰</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="5" xml:id="f13-r-c05">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">是佳兆也當戰止而發熱熱退而諸症了了果如所</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="6" xml:id="f13-r-c06">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">言調理四五日漸漸恢復適會夫婦反目因與小柴</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="7" xml:id="f13-r-c07">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">胡湯翌日午後自汗如流昏暮予往而視之脈微遲</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text" corresp="#f13-r-c07">
              <label>右頁第二欄「甜」右旁小字</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">活</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="column" n="1" xml:id="f13-l-c01">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">無力四肢厥冷筋惕肉瞤伏卧呻吟是流汗不止而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="2" xml:id="f13-l-c02">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">脫亡眞陽也自非附子不能囘陽急飮眞武湯周時</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="3" xml:id="f13-l-c03">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">脈轉濬而有力四肢溫和諸若氷釋調和十餘日而</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="column" n="4" xml:id="f13-l-c04">
              <seg type="diplomatic-text">全已</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：第二欄正文「甜」左有舌形，右甘，旁有更訂用小字「活」；保留兩層。第三欄「舌胎」按形。末欄「昏暮」之昏上部收成圈狀。 左面：第1欄「卧」無人旁；「瞤」右門內細。第3欄脈轉後左水，右形近「濬／緩」。氷字左有點形。「諸若」的若上似艹，亦候苦。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:1">
              <quote>筋惕</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">筋惕</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">筋煬</seg>
              <note type="editorial">原圖留讀及異讀候選。</note>
            </ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:3">
              <quote>諸若</quote>
              <seg type="candidate">諸若</seg>
              <seg type="candidate">諸苦</seg>
              <note type="editorial">原圖留讀及異讀候選。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="14" facs="#f14" />
        <div n="14" type="scan" subtype="housing-binding-or-empty-leaves">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：正面白紙。 左面：全面白紙，左下折角。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="15" facs="#f15" />
        <div n="15" type="scan" subtype="housing-binding-or-empty-leaves">
          <div type="page-face" n="right">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="page-face" n="left">
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="printed-small-text">
              <label>左下折角淡墨</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">□□</seg>
            </ab>
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">右面：右面未見可辨文字。 左面：折角露出的淡墨筆畫不全，字數約略。</ab>
            <ab type="transcription-issue" n="left:None">
              <quote>左下折角淡墨</quote>
              <note type="editorial">此處墨跡或構件不清，以□保留未定字。</note>
            </ab>
          </div>
        </div>
        <pb n="16" facs="#f16" />
        <div n="16" type="scan" subtype="housing-binding-or-empty-leaves">
          <div type="page-face" n="single">
            <ab type="no-transcribed-text" />
          </div>
          <div type="editorial-observations">
            <ab type="layout">單幅：後封斑駁，未見書寫。</ab>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
